-- Phase 0: member profile fields, baptismal records and the reshaped connect
-- groups (docs/SCOPE.md §6, People / Groups / Baptismal record).
--
-- Generated by `prisma migrate diff`, then reviewed. Destructive only for the
-- draft Group columns: `createdById`, `isActive` and `GroupMembership.isLeader`
-- are dropped and a NOT NULL `slug` is added without a default. That is safe
-- because no screen or action has ever written a Group row — the model was a
-- draft with no UI — so the table is empty on every deployment. The seven
-- groups are created by `npm run db:seed`, which supplies the slugs.
--
-- The new AuditAction values are only added here, never used in this
-- migration, which is what lets PostgreSQL add them inside a transaction.

